---

Panway is a rebranded and extended fork of One API
(https://github.com/songquanpeng/one-api), MIT licensed.

Panway-specific changes:
- Rebranded to "Panway" (system name, frontend copy, module path, database
  file name, CLI usage text).
- PanRouter model pricing defaults (relay/billing/ratio/panrouter.go).
- PanWallet integration: wallet linking, live balance check, and top-up sync
  (common/walletclient, controller/wallet.go, model/wallet_link.go).
- Tolerant JSON decoding for upstreams that append "data: [DONE]" to a
  non-streaming response (relay/adaptor/openai/json.go).
- IPv6-safe SMTP address building (common/message/email.go).
